# ROG Mech
mode clock
view digital
set hour-24 true
set seconds true
date "%a %d %b %Y"

style background clear
style active-bg #ff2233
style active-fg #ff2233
style inactive-bg #161d26
style inactive-fg #161d26
style colon-bg #d6dde6
style colon-fg #d6dde6
style date #555c68
style text #d6dde6
style prompt #ff2233
style success #d6dde6
style error #6b0a12
